 =20
  <p style=3D"margin: 16px 0;"><strong>Use a fast model for classification,=
 a strong model for generation.</strong> Same endpoint, same auth, differen=
t model parameter. That is the point of having 300+ models on one API: you =
mix them per step instead of committing to one for the whole workload.</p>
