    <p style=3D"color: #71717a; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin: =
0 0 8px 0; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">PATTERN 1: C=
LASSIFY, THEN GENERATE</p>

    <div style=3D"background: #18181b; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 2=
0px; font-family: 'SF Mono', 'Fira Code', 'Courier New', monospace; font-si=
